<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka '96 agriculture production down 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka '96 agriculture production down 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's agriculture sector declined by 4.6 percent in 1996, compared to a growth of 3.3 percent in the previous year, the Central Bank said in its annual report on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
